repository-code: "https://github.com/godofthunder101/CrypSA"
abstract: >
  CrypSA is a distributed architecture for persistent digital universes.
  It separates local observer simulation from canonical event reconciliation,
  allowing scalable shared worlds without centralized continuous simulation.
